---
import Docs from '../layouts/Docs.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<Docs title="Introduction">
  <p>Cuttle UI is a set of simple, catchy, accessible components for every framework.</p>
  <p>
    Behavior lives in a framework-free core of state machines and DOM utilities. Thin adapters
    connect that core to React first, then Vue, Angular, Svelte and Web Components.
  </p>
  <p>
    The project is in its foundation phase, so no components are available yet. Start with{' '}
    <a href={`${base}/installation`}>Installation</a> or see how <a href={`${base}/theming`}>theming</a> works.
  </p>
</Docs>
